rooms_desc ({"This room looks like a bomb hit it. There are empty cans of paint all overthe floor and paint is everywhere. There is a big smeared patch in the middleof the floor where it looks like someone has been rolling around in the paint.You can also see what seem to be articles of clothing scattered around theroom.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
